OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for throwing #12,000
OL,4,Adrugs into prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who threw a package containing
OL,7,Fmore than #12,000 worth of illegal
OL,8,Fdrugs into a prison has been jailed.
OL,10,FPolice received a report on 11 July
OL,11,Flast year from a prison guard at HMP
OL,12,FHull who saw a parcel falling over the
OL,13,Fwall after it had been thrown by
OL,14,F30-year-old Joshua Smith.
OL,16,FOn Monday, Smith, of no fixed address,
OL,17,Fwas sentenced at Hull Crown Court to
OL,18,Fthree years and eight months in jail
OL,19,Fafter pleading guilty at an earlier
OL,20,Fhearing to two counts of throwing a
OL,21,Fprohibited article into a prison.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
