OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for throwing #12,000
OL,4,Adrugs into prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Con Heather Butler, from Humberside
OL,7,FPolice, said: "The package was analysed
OL,8,Fleading to the discovery of an
OL,9,Festimated #12,000 of drugs, including
OL,10,Fclass A drugs, and a mobile phone."
